WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Welcome to Fun with Shapes! Shapes make our world wonderful and strong.

2
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:27.280
A circle is perfectly round with 1 curved edge and zero corners. It rolls smoothly like a wheel.

3
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:42.730
A triangle has 3 straight sides and 3 vertices. Triangles give village roofs great strength.

4
00:00:42.730 --> 00:01:00.390
Squares and rectangles have 4 straight sides. Flat rectangular bricks stack tightly into sturdy walls.

5
00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:11.930
Remember: 2D shapes are flat, while 3D shapes take up space. Keep exploring shapes around you!
